WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.891
Learn to identify numbers in different positions around a given number in a number

00:00:04.891 --> 00:00:09.247
chart and compare and order whole numbers up to 10,000 and represent comparisons

00:00:09.247 --> 00:00:13.939
using the symbols “ less than ”, “ equals ”, “ greater than ”

00:00:14.783 --> 00:00:23.257
On a number chart with steps of 1,000, what is directly after 1,270? The answer is

00:00:23.257 --> 00:00:26.965
2,270. Move forward one step of 1,000.

00:00:27.783 --> 00:00:34.663
Kofi is on box 3,545 of a number chart counting by 10. What box comes next? Pause and

00:00:34.663 --> 00:00:36.957
solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:37.783 --> 00:00:41.431
The answer is 3,555. Add 10.
